[signs]
; x y message -- each must stand on an 'S' tile and be reachable. The text may contain spaces.
7 5 Moonpetal Meadow: the village lies east along the path, and the old copper rocks are scattered round the edges.
15 9 Mind the pond. The water is deeper than it looks, and the fence rail to the south keeps careless travellers out.
